-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- the network layer in binary
-- Energies of networks combine many vertex coefficients, whose denominators multiply; in unary that is the size of
-- the number (721/486 from w(2,3)'s 313/1944 took 2.4·10⁹ steps), in binary its length. So a vertex's form is turned
-- into binary rationals once and the network layer works there.
BRad : Type
BRad = Nat × (Nat × BQ)
